## Third-party components

- **No third-party JavaScript.** The H5 application uses only hand-written
  vanilla JavaScript; there is no bundled framework, no CDN reference and no
  runtime dependency.
- **No third-party icons.** Launcher icons under `app/res/mipmap-*` are
  original artwork created for this project.
- **Android SDK / build-tools are NOT distributed.** The `android/sdk`
  directory present in some local working copies is a build-time toolchain
  downloaded from Google and is intentionally excluded from this repository
  by `.gitignore`. Only the project's own sources are published here.
- The signed APK in `release/` was built with Android build-tools 35.0.0
  (aapt2 / d8 / apksigner). The APK embeds only this project's own assets.

